      "widgets_values": [
        "Image 1 is a front portrait of LEAD.\nKeep LEAD's exact face, skin tone, skin texture and hair from image 1. Do not beautify or change their age.\nLEAD: Retired harbour pilot. Tall and lean, usually in a navy wool peacoat over a dark knit sweater.\nA cinematic film still: LEAD at a rain-streaked window at night, lit by passing car lights, lost in thought.\nMedium shot from the waist up, anamorphic lens with oval bokeh and horizontal flares, lit only by practical lamps in the scene, a grounded, dramatic tone.\nNatural skin texture with visible pores, real lens imperfections."
      ],
